      en: ["Established in 1970 as a joint venture between government and Orient Paper.", "Located in Webuye town, Bungoma County, western Kenya.", "Was once the largest integrated pulp and paper mill in East Africa.", "Faced collapse in 2009 due to high costs and mismanagement.", "Acquired by the Rai Group in 2016 and renamed Rai Paper.", "Reopening has provided a vital economic boost to the Webuye region."],
